		(property "Description" "25 V VCEO, 40 V VCBO: with 120 ohm from base to emitter it holds the 30 V supply. Current limit: above 0.6 V across the 120 ohm (5 mA, 4 mA hot) it feeds SP_FB and pulls the output down; an output shorted to 0 V draws 5 mA (op amp: 80 mA unlimited). Off below 3 mA (load 5 k and more)"
